window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Book five of the best-selling Contamination series, with more than 3,000 five-star reviews across Amazon!</p> <p>In a world gone mad, no one is safe.</p> <p>Ever since leaving the salvage yard, Noah Chambers has been plagued by the infected and hunted by the men who patrol the streets. In order to survive, he'll need to summon strength he never imagined. Will he survive?</p>"; 
